---
// /epg — RETIRED from Couch Mode (W3).
//
// The old standalone guide page is gone: the full programme guide
// now lives as Mode C inside Live TV (`#livetv-mode-guide`,
// TvGuideView). This route stays only as a redirect so bookmarks,
// deep links, the system-tray route table and the legacy /tv/live
// mapping keep working — it sends the user straight to
// /livetv?mode=guide, which activates the Guide on load.
//
// The EPG ENGINE (epg.ts / epg-data.js / mapping.ts) is untouched:
// only this page's old UI is retired.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/livetv?mode=guide" />
    <title>Programme guide — NylahBox Studios</title>
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace("/livetv?mode=guide");
    </script>
  </head>
  <body style="background:#170a0c;color:#f8f1f2;font-family:sans-serif;padding:2rem">
    <p>
      The programme guide has moved into Live TV.
      <a href="/livetv?mode=guide" style="color:#eaa9b8">Continue to the guide</a>
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
